<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/aid> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Asset Interfaces Description (IDTA 02017-1-1, W3C WoT TD aligned).\r
\r
  Submodel semanticId: https://admin-shell.io/idta/AssetInterfacesDescription/1/0/Submodel\r
  Interface semanticId: https://admin-shell.io/idta/AssetInterfacesDescription/1/0/Interface""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/aimc> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Asset Interfaces Mapping Configuration (IDTA 02027).\r
\r
  Maps AID interface elements onto other submodel elements. Depends on AID:\r
  every Source reference resolves into an AID interface's InteractionMetadata.""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/capabilities> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Capability Description (IDTA 02020-1-0).\r
\r
  Submodel semanticId: https://admin-shell.io/idta/SubmodelTemplate/CapabilityDescription/1/0\r
  Cross-submodel: CapabilityRealizedBy.second must reference a Skill in the Skills SM of the same AAS (enforced via SPARQL SHACL).""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/control-component> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Control Component / Skills -- an ARSO-flattened adaptation of IDTA 02015-2-0 ControlComponentType (February 2025). See the design note above for how this diverges from the full standard. v0.5 adds optional reconfiguration elements per skill (Kind, Parameters, RealizesProperty, Contract, Uses, Execute/Stop, Occupies, StateReference, Implementation).\r
\r
  Submodel semanticId: https://admin-shell.io/idta/ControlComponentType/1/0\r
  Cross-submodel: Skill InterfaceReference targets are validated in SPARQL SHACL (arso-rules.shacl.ttl).""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/control-configuration> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Control Configuration (custom, v0.5). The reflection of a
  controller in its resource AAS: which program runs, whether it still matches the
  source it was generated from, the type hashes the runtime reports, the active
  procedure and the log of reconfigurations. Written by modsync (as idShort
  ControlSoftware until it is renamed).""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/hierarchical-structures> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Hierarchical Structures enabling Bills of Material (IDTA 02011-1-1, June 2024).\r
\r
  Submodel semanticId: https://admin-shell.io/idta/HierarchicalStructures/1/1/Submodel""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/nameplate> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment """ARSO module: Digital Nameplate (IDTA 02006-3-0, November 2024).\r
\r
  Submodel semanticId: https://admin-shell.io/idta/nameplate/3/0/Nameplate""" ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/operational-data> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment "ARSO module: Operational Data (Custom)." ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/parameters> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:comment "ARSO module: Parameters (Custom)." ;
    owl:imports <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/1/> .

<https://w3id.org/2025/arso/modules/technical-data> a owl:Ontology ;
